      "content": "Guilt stems from trying to protect them, but hiding from their struggles only causes you more pain in the long run. Their love for your real self, flaws and all, is far more important than the image of your success. Please lean on a friend or counselor who can give you the space you need to heal without worry. You are still worth loving, and your true self deserves a safe place to be vulnerable.",
