      "content": "but that's the thing, they don't love the \"flawed\" version of me. they love the version that's going to be a doctor, the version that never makes mistakes. if i stay, i just have to spend the rest of my life being this pathetic, disappointing shadow of who i was. it feels like the only way to keep that version of me alive—the version they’re actually proud of—is to just not let them see me like this. if i just disappeared now, at least that's the last thing they'd have.",
